    'Price took up the charge, made by Elijah Muhammad of the Nation of Islam, that the Bible is a poison book that had poisoned Black people. He admitted that the Church’s own track record opened the door for it, and then he answered it: the poison comes from people who twisted the Book, not from the Book. If a criminal uses a Ford in a getaway, you do not shut down the Ford Motor Company. "Read the Bible right and use it right!" And he declared, "This is not the white man’s religion; that is the lie that has been disseminated through the centuries. This is God’s Word for everyone who is willing to receive it."',
